%% Derived from: feature/feed/PlayerScreen.kt (PlayerScreen + PlayerPage: pager, gestures,
%% ended/error listeners, idle hide, player adoption), core/player/GiffyPlayer.kt (playGif,
%% preloadNeighbors, rendition cache key), app-mobile/src/androidTest/.../PlayerScreenMachineTest.kt
%% (tap toggles controls without pausing, hold 2x, double-tap like — verified on device).
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Preparing

    note right of Preparing
      Player route pushed - playGif(gif, dataSaver, resumeMs = 0, videoQuality).
      Player adoption issue #9 - an already-playing inline preview is adopted
      at its live position (just playWhenReady = true) instead of re-preparing.
    end note

    Preparing --> PlaybackFailed: Player.onPlayerError
    Preparing --> Playing: ready (playWhenReady = true)

    Playing --> Paused: control-row pause
    Paused --> Playing: control-row play (playOrRestart - seek 0 first at stream end)
    Playing --> Ended: playback reaches end

    Ended --> Playing: auto-swipe OFF - loop, seekTo(0) + play
    Ended --> NextPage: autoSwipe && !dataSaver - animate or scroll to next page

    Playing --> NextPage: swipe prev or next (zoom 1x-3x + pan reset per page)
    Paused --> NextPage: swipe

    PlaybackFailed --> Playing: Retry (re-run playGif)
    PlaybackFailed --> NextPage: Skip

    NextPage --> Preparing: next gif - every play starts at 0 (resume removed 2026-10)
    NextPage --> PoolEndPending: currentPage + 1 == itemCount - ended while the next page fetches
    PoolEndPending --> Preparing: pendingAdvance - next page lands, advance re-fired
    PoolEndPending --> Playing: no more pages - loop last (or random jump when shuffleSeed active)

    state "controls visible" as CV
    state "controls hidden" as CH
    Playing --> CV: single tap - UI only, never pauses (issue #2)
    CV --> CH: tap again, or 3s idle auto-hide (only while playing and not scrubbing)
    CH --> CV: tap, or a11y custom action "Show playback controls"

    note right of CV
      Double-tap = like once, never unlike (logged out opens the account surface);
      heart pop animation. Holding the body engages hold-to-2x, restores on release.
    end note

    Playing --> Closed: BACK
    Paused --> Closed: BACK

    note right of Closed
      Overlay creator/tag/niche link opens ARE exits - the nav push pops this
      player entry, so BACK lands the covered feed with its scroll state intact.
    end note

    note right of Closed
      On close an adopted player is RETURNED to the FeedViewModel (parks for
      the feed again), a freshly built player is RELEASED; system bars restored.
    end note

    Closed --> [*]
